\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 GOP nominee for Virginia governor tries to distance herself from anti- \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  past\b0\par\par\uc2 Susan Rinkunas \par \uc2 887 \uc2 words\par \uc2 30 May 2025\par 11:01 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2025.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Winsome Earle-Sears called \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  \u8216\'20\'18genocide\u8217\'20\'19 and implied equivalence between consenting to sex and consenting to pregnancy\par \par \uc2 The Republican nominee for governor of Virginia has recently tried to distance herself from her long-standing, hardline anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  record, declining recently to state whether she would support any restrictions on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  access if she is elected to lead the state this fall. But her record reveals a candidate staunchly opposed to the procedure.\par \par \uc2 Winsome Earle-Sears, now the state\u8217\'20\'19s lieutenant governor, supported a 15-week \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban and has previously said she wants to make \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  illegal in almost all cases. In audio obtained by the Guardian, Earle-Sears also suggested an equivalence between consenting to sex and consenting to pregnancy.\par \par \uc2 Virginia is the only state in the US south without a strict \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban, and \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  is legal in the state through the end of the second trimester of pregnancy. The state\u8217\'20\'19s current Republican governor, \uc2 Glenn Youngkin\uc2 , {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://19thnews.org/2023/11/virginia-voters-reject-republican-campaign-abortion-ban/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 previously failed}}}\uc2  to build support for a 15-week \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban, a framework Earle-Sears {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wric.com/news/virginia-news/watch-live-lt-gov-winsome-earle-sears-on-abortion-rights-in-virginia/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 endorsed}}}\uc2 . While campaigning for lieutenant governor in January 2021, before {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/roe-v-wade"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Roe v Wade}}}\uc2  was overturned and support for \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights rose among the US public, Earle-Sears told a reporter that she considered \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  to be \u8220\'20\'1C{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.winchesterstar.com/winchester_star/stephenson-resident-seeking-gop-nomination-in-lieutenant-governors-race/article_20653dc1-0cd4-509e-b5cc-5da9717eadb5.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 genocide}}}\uc2 \u8221\'20\'1D and that she wanted to make \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  illegal in all cases unless the mother\u8217\'20\'19s life was at risk.\par \par \uc2 But she has recently struck a different tone. In a local news {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wric.com/news/politics/capitol-connection/8news-exclusive-earle-sears-declines-to-say-if-shell-sign-a-bill-limiting-abortion-access-if-elected-governor/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 interview}}}\uc2  last week, a reporter with WRIC 8News asked Earle-Sears about her past support for limiting \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  access. She replied: \u8220\'20\'1CI never said limiting access.\u8221\'20\'1D Sears, who is Black, then referenced \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rates among Black women and asked: \u8220\'20\'1CWho doesn\u8217\'20\'19t want us to have babies?\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 When asked if she would sign a law banning \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  at 15 weeks or less, Earle-Sears said: \u8220\'20\'1CWe\u8217\'20\'19re not limiting access at all. That\u8217\'20\'19s not what we\u8217\'20\'19re saying. As a matter of fact, what we really need to do is get together and try to figure out, where is the limit?\u8221\'20\'1D <aside class="element element-rich-link element--thumbnail">\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/ng-interactive/2025/apr/23/anti-abortion-fetal-personhood"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 How idea of charging women with murder infiltrated the anti-\b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  movement}}}\uc2  </aside>\par \par \uc2 Virginians broadly support \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights, with {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.prri.org/research/abortion-views-in-all-50-states-findings-from-prris-2023-american-values-atlas/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 71%}}}\uc2  saying \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  should be legal in all or most cases per a 2023 Public Religion Research Institute survey.\par \par \uc2 The interview comes as some GOP strategists told Politico that Earle-Sears is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.politico.com/news/2025/05/19/virginia-gop-winsome-earle-sears-worries-00357698"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 struggling to make traction}}}\uc2 , citing slow fundraising and controversial comments connecting slavery to diversity, equity and inclusion programs. Her campaign wrote in a fundraising email: \u8220\'20\'1CSlaves did not die in the fields so that we could call ourselves victims now in 2025.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Polling shows Earle-Sears trailing the Democratic nominee, former representative Abigail Spanberger, by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.realclearpolling.com/polls/governor/general/2025/virginia/spanberger-vs-earle-sears"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 nearly seven points}}}\uc2  according to polling averages. Virginia gubernatorial races often swing in the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsls.com/news/local/2025/05/03/why-is-virginias-2025-election-so-important/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 opposite}}}\uc2  direction of the presidency.\par \par \uc2 Earle-Sears may be attempting to strike a softer tone on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  in advance of the November election, but she has made hardline anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  statements for years. In a little-noticed radio interview from June 2022, Earle-Sears suggested to then conservative radio host John Reid, now the Republican {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nytimes.com/2025/05/08/us/politics/youngkin-john-reid-virginia-republicans.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 nominee for lieutenant governor}}}\uc2 , that women consenting to sex are consenting to pregnancy. \u8220\'20\'1CWe need to make our choices before we\u8217\'20\'19re pregnant, not, you know, after,\u8221\'20\'1D she said, just days after the supreme court overturned Roe. \u8220\'20\'1CYou already made a choice.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 That comment was of a piece with other past statements. In September 2021, Earle-Sears said on \uc2 Newsmax\uc2  that she {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/HalaAyala/status/1434161576525893633"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 supported a six-week \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  ban}}}\uc2  like the one that had just taken effect in Texas. Her campaign website\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://web.archive.org/web/20210901041309/https://winsomesears.com/issues/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1Cissues\u8221\'20\'1D page}}}\uc2  previously included an anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  section where she referred to \u8220\'20\'1Clate-term \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8221\'20\'1D as murder. (\b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  opponents use that term to refer to abortions later in pregnancy; in obstetrics, \u8220\'20\'1Clate term\u8221\'20\'1D refers to a pregnancy after 40 weeks.) She scrubbed the site of that section in 2021.\par \par \uc2 Most recently, Earle-Sears, who is required as the state\u8217\'20\'19s senate president to add her signature to bills that pass the legislature, added a note to a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://virginiamercury.com/2025/02/13/virginia-moves-to-protect-reproductive-and-voting-rights-but-the-fight-is-far-from-over/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 constitutional amendment}}}\uc2  to codify \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights that the legislature passed in May. The Virginia Mercury {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://virginiamercury.com/2025/05/08/earle-sears-morally-opposed-to-virginias-reproductive-rights-amendment-note-shows/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reported}}}\uc2  that she wrote above her signature: \u8220\'20\'1CI am morally opposed to this bill; no protection for the child.\u8221\'20\'1D The amendment must pass the legislature again next year before it can go to voters.\par \par \uc2 The Earle-Sears campaign declined to comment on the record on her recent interview as well as the 2022 interview.\par \par \uc2 Reid, the lieutenant governor nominee, has been {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.politico.com/news/2025/05/03/youngkin-reid-virginia-lieutenant-governor-gop-00325189"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 mired in his own scandal}}}\uc2  for allegedly maintaining a social media account featuring photos of nude men. Governor Youngkin {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nytimes.com/2025/05/08/us/politics/youngkin-john-reid-virginia-republicans.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 asked him to drop out}}}\uc2  of the race, but Reid, Virginia\u8217\'20\'19s first openly gay candidate for statewide office, has denied connection to the photos and claimed that attempts to push him constitute discrimination against his sexual orientation.\par \par \uc2 Following news of the photos, Earle-Sears cancelled events with Reid. News also broke that, last year, she wrote a note on a marriage equality bill saying that she was \u8220\'20\'1C{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nbcwashington.com/news/politics/gop-candidate-for-virginia-governor-wrote-anti-same-sex-marriage-note-on-bill/3905651/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 morally opposed}}}\uc2 \u8221\'20\'1D to same-sex marriage. Politico {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.politico.com/news/2025/05/19/virginia-gop-winsome-earle-sears-worries-00357698"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 described}}}\uc2  the relationship between the two nominees at the Republican ticket as \u8220\'20\'1Cfrosty\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020250530el5u001e4\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
