\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 Fetus of brain-dead Georgia woman kept alive due to  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  ban is growing, says family\b0\par\par\uc2 Carter Sherman \par \uc2 839 \uc2 words\par \uc2 24 May 2025\par 11:33 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2025.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Hospital plans to keep Adriana Smith on life support until August, when doctors will deliver baby via C-section\par \par \uc2 The foetus of a brain-dead Georgia woman who is being kept alive to carry out her pregnancy is continuing to grow, the woman\u8217\'20\'19s mother said late Monday, days after the controversial case exploded into the national news and sparked questions about the ethics of using the state\u8217\'20\'19s anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  law to keep a woman with no chance of recovery on life support.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CHe has his toes, arms, limbs \u8211\'20\'13 everything is forming,\u8221\'20\'1D the woman\u8217\'20\'19s mother, April Newkirk, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.11alive.com/article/news/health/update-pregnant-mom-brain-dead-life-support-baby-update/85-1b691c47-dff7-438f-9054-58957d97666e"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told the local news station 11Alive}}}\uc2 . \u8220\'20\'1CWe\u8217\'20\'19re just hoping he makes it.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The Georgia woman, Adriana Smith, went to a hospital in February with what she thought was an intense headache, Newkirk, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.11alive.com/article/news/local/family-claims-atlanta-nurse-declared-brain-dead-kept-alive-pregnancy/85-eac5257d-a329-4dd7-b80f-5c0ecd30225a"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told 11 Alive}}}\uc2 , which first reported the story. At the time, Smith was about eight weeks into her pregnancy. <aside class="element element-rich-link element--thumbnail">\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/commentisfree/2025/may/24/adriana-smith-georgia-tayo-bero"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dear America: women\u8217\'20\'19s bodies are not state property | Tayo Bero}}}\uc2  </aside>\par \par \uc2 The hospital discharged Smith after providing her with medication, Newkirk said. The next day, Smith was rushed back to the hospital after she woke up gasping for air. The hospital diagnosed her with blood clots in her brain. Within hours, she was declared brain-dead.\par \par \uc2 Under Georgia law, \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  is banned after about six weeks of pregnancy. That ban also contains provisions that strengthen the concept of \u8220\'20\'1Cfetal personhood\u8221\'20\'1D, a doctrine that holds that embryos and foetuses should be considered people \u8211\'20\'13 and, as such, are entitled to full legal rights and protections. Newkirk said doctors told the family the law requires keeping her alive to preserve the pregnancy.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe didn\u8217\'20\'19t have a choice or a say about it,\u8221\'20\'1D Newkirk said. \u8220\'20\'1CWe want the baby. That\u8217\'20\'19s a part of my daughter. But the decision should have been left to us \u8211\'20\'13 not the state.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Smith is currently about 22 weeks into her pregnancy. The hospital plans to keep Smith on life support until early August, when doctors will deliver the baby through a caesarean section, 11Alive reported.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe chances of there being a healthy newborn at the end of this is very, very small,\u8221\'20\'1D Steven Ralston, the director of the maternal fetal medicine division at \uc2 George Washington University\uc2 , {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.washingtonpost.com/nation/2025/05/19/georgia-mother-pregnant-brain-dead/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told the Washington Post}}}\uc2 . Newkirk said last week that the baby has fluid in the brain. \u8220\'20\'1CHe may be blind, may not be able to walk, may not survive once he\u8217\'20\'19s born,\u8221\'20\'1D she said.\par \par \uc2 The family has named the baby Chance, Newkirk said.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CRight now, the journey is for baby Chance to survive,\u8221\'20\'1D Newkirk said on Monday. \u8220\'20\'1CWhatever condition God allows him to come here in, we\u8217\'20\'19re going to love him just the same.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Smith\u8217\'20\'19s case has sparked a nationwide debate about medical consent and the potentially sweeping reach of anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  laws. \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights activists have spent years warning about these laws\u8217\'20\'19 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/ng-interactive/2025/apr/23/anti-abortion-fetal-personhood"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 unforeseen consequences}}}\uc2 , as {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/society/2024/mar/20/states-fetal-personhood-bill"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 instituting fetal personhood}}}\uc2  can lead to the rights of a pregnant person being pitted against that of the foetus inside them. In the years since Roe v Wade\u8217\'20\'19s 2022 overturning, dozens of pregnant women have said that \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  bans led them to be denied abortions even in medical emergencies.\par \par \uc2 The hospital where Smith is currently located has not commented on her case, citing privacy laws. However, it said {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/may/15/pregnant-georgia-woman-brain-dead-abortion-law"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 in a statement}}}\uc2  that it \u8220\'20\'1Cuses consensus from clinical experts, medical literature, and legal guidance to support our providers as they make individualized treatment recommendations in compliance with Georgia\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  laws and all other applicable laws\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 The office of Georgia\u8217\'20\'19s attorney general, \uc2 Chris Carr\uc2 , has released a statement declaring that Georgia\u8217\'20\'19s six-week law does not require medical professionals to keep women alive on life support after being declared brain-dead.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CRemoving life support is not an action with the purpose to terminate a pregnancy,\u8221\'20\'1D Carr\u8217\'20\'19s spokesperson, Kara Murray, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.11alive.com/article/news/politics/ag-heartbeat-law-misapplied-case-pregnant-georgia-mom-kept-alive/85-0eabfb9f-24cd-4222-8c50-2f6806aa4822"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said in the statement}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Some anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  advocates, however, have taken the opposite view. Georgia state Sen. Ed Setzler, who sponsored the state\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://apnews.com/article/pregnant-woman-brain-dead-abortion-ban-georgia-a85a5906e5b2c4889525f2300c441745"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told the Associated Press}}}\uc2  that \u8220\'20\'1Cit is completely appropriate that the hospital do what they can to save the life of the child\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 He continued: \u8220\'20\'1CI think this is an unusual circumstance, but I think it highlights the value of innocent human life. I think the hospital is acting appropriately.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Students for Life of America, a powerful national anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  group, has also backed the decision to keep Smith on life support.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWhile Adriana can no longer speak for herself, her son\u8217\'20\'19s life still matters. Her doctors are doing the right thing by treating him as a unique patient,\u8221\'20\'1D the organization said in a statement, which was accompanied by a fundraiser for Smith\u8217\'20\'19s family.\par \par \uc2 Smith\u8217\'20\'19s family has their own fundraiser to help cover costs associated with her care and the possibilities that her son will be born with disabilities. \par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020250520el5k00337\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
