\par\par \uc2 Opinion\par \b \uc2 Will Jeffrey Epstein\u8217\'20\'19s victims ever get justice?\b0\par\par\uc2 Arwa Mahdawi \par \uc2 1,542 \uc2 words\par \uc2 5 May 2025\par 17:24 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2025.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 I have a suggestion for conspiracy theorists: instead of searching for secret plots, why not grapple with some very clear facts?\par \par \uc2 A tragedy \u8211\'20\'13 not a conspiracy\par \par \uc2 Last weekend the terrible news broke that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/apr/26/virginia-giuffre-suicide-dead-aged-41"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Virginia Giuffre}}}\uc2 , one of the most prominent victims of the disgraced US financier {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/jeffrey-epstein"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Jeffrey Epstein}}}\uc2 , had died by suicide. Conspiracy theorists immediately started circling. A tweet from 2019, in which Giuffre said she wasn\u8217\'20\'19t suicidal, was dredged up. \uc2 Donald Trump Jr\uc2 , the president\u8217\'20\'19s eldest {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://nymag.com/intelligencer/2021/06/andrew-giuilani-andrew-cuomo-and-the-age-of-the-failson.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 failson}}}\uc2 , then amplified the theory to his millions of followers, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/DonaldJTrumpJr/status/1916100737387692380"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 adding that}}}\uc2  \u8220\'20\'1Cother than the Clinton\u8217\'20\'19s [sic] no one has more suiciding going on\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Laura Loomer, a far-right influencer who seems to wield a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/apr/04/who-is-laura-loomer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 huge amount of influence}}}\uc2  in the Trump administration, also started insinuating online that Giuffre had been silenced by dark forces. \u8220\'20\'1CWe are never getting the Epstein list, are we?\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/LauraLoomer/status/1915943274893750283"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Loomer tweeted.}}}\par \par \uc2 Various other people amplifying this conspiracy theory have noted that Giuffre isn\u8217\'20\'19t the first Epstein survivor to have died in recent years. In 2023, Carolyn Andriano, who had accused Epstein of abusing her when she was 14 and who testified against Ghislaine Maxwell in her trial, was found dead of an accidental overdose in a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.usatoday.com/story/news/nation/2023/10/17/jeffrey-epstein-survivor-death-overdose-florida-carolyn-andriano/71221137007/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Florida hotel room}}}\uc2 . Andriano testified in 2021 that she had been addicted to \u8220\'20\'1Cpain pills and cocaine\u8221\'20\'1D and taken them \u8220\'20\'1Cto block out\u8221\'20\'1D Epstein\u8217\'20\'19s sexual abuse. Another of Epstein\u8217\'20\'19s victims, Leigh Patrick, also {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.dailymail.co.uk/news/article-14652325/Virginia-Giuffre-social-media-post-conspiracy-theories.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reportedly died}}}\uc2  of a heroin overdose in Florida in 2017.\par \par \uc2 The fact that three Epstein survivors have died by drug overdose or suicide is enraging and tragic, but it is not a conspiracy. I have a suggestion for the likes of Donald Jr and Loomer: instead of searching for secret plots, why not grapple with some very clear facts? The first being that childhood sexual abuse is associated {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.ox.ac.uk/news/2019-09-12-childhood-sexual-abuse-linked-range-physical-and-mental-health-conditions"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 with a wide range}}}\uc2  of physical and mental health conditions, including {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://jamanetwork.com/journals/jamapsychiatry/fullarticle/481660"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 substance abuse}}}\uc2 . In a statement praising Giuffre\u8217\'20\'19s courage, the Rape, Abuse & Incest National Network (Rainn) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/apr/26/virginia-giuffre-suicide-dead-aged-41"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 warned that victims}}}\uc2  of abuse are \u8220\'20\'1Csignificantly more likely to attempt suicide or suffer other long term effects of trauma\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 The \u8220\'20\'1Cconspiracy\u8221\'20\'1D that Donald Jr and Loomer are searching so hard to find isn\u8217\'20\'19t hidden, it\u8217\'20\'19s staring them right in the face. Far too often, when a woman accuses a powerful man of abuse she will have her life destroyed, while the man walks away. Society is set up to protect powerful predators and their enablers: misogyny is woven into the fabric of all our institutions. Look at the supreme court, where two of the six men serving {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.huffpost.com/entry/brett-kavanaugh-clarence-thomas_n_5bb761b5e4b0876eda9d73e8"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 have faced sexual misconduct allegations}}}\uc2 . \uc2 Anita Hill\uc2  had her {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.newyorker.com/news/news-desk/what-joe-biden-hasnt-owned-up-to-about-anita-hill"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reputation destroyed}}}\uc2  after accusing \uc2 Clarence Thomas\uc2 , then a supreme court nominee, of sexually harassing her. Christine Blasey Ford, Justice \uc2 Brett Kavanaugh\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s accuser, was forced to flee her {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.msnbc.com/rachel-maddow-show/trump-feels-terribly-kavanaugh-his-accuser-flees-her-home-msna1145306"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 house to protect her safety}}}\uc2 . (Both justices deny the allegations.)\par \par \uc2 And, of course, look at the White House. Trump was {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2023/may/10/trump-trial-verdict-white-house-2024-run"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 legally branded}}}\uc2  a sexual predator in 2023 and it didn\u8217\'20\'19t stop him from becoming president again.\par \par \uc2 Look too at all the years that Epstein evaded justice; all the years he rubbed shoulders with some of the most powerful people in the world who didn\u8217\'20\'19t seem to care about his predilection for young girls. Which, by the way, hardly seemed to be a secret. Trump joked about Epstein liking women on the \u8220\'20\'1C{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2019/aug/10/jeffrey-epstein-life-profile"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 younger side}}}\uc2 \u8221\'20\'1D back in 2002. Florida prosecutors also reportedly knew that Epstein assaulted young girls {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/jul/01/jeffrey-epstein-transcript"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 years}}}\uc2  before he cut a very lenient deal with them in 2008. In that deal {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/jul/01/jeffrey-epstein-transcript"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 he pleaded guilty}}}\uc2  to state charges of procuring a person under 18 for prostitution and solicitation of prostitution. The financier had to register as a sex offender and serve a 13-month sentence, but was allowed to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.pbs.org/newshour/nation/florida-sheriff-investigates-epsteins-time-spent-outside-of-jail"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 spend most of his day}}}\uc2  in his office.\par \par \uc2 I can understand why conspiracy theorists are so obsessed with Epstein. After all, the man operated a vast sex-trafficking ring with the help of an {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.pbs.org/newshour/show/what-the-newly-released-jeffrey-epstein-documents-reveal-about-his-sex-trafficking-ring"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 enormous number}}}\uc2  of powerful people. And yet, five years after the sex offender\u8217\'20\'19s death, the only person to have faced any real consequences is Ghislaine Maxwell, who is in a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.independent.co.uk/news/world/americas/ghislaine-maxwell-prison-tallahassee-epstein-b2485294.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 low-security federal prison}}}\uc2 . Some high-profile men have been embarrassed, sure, but nobody except Maxwell is in prison. It\u8217\'20\'19s not a conspiracy that\u8217\'20\'19s to blame for this: it\u8217\'20\'19s society\u8217\'20\'19s attitudes toward women.\par \par \uc2 Logan Paul has daughter, realizes that women are human too\par \par \uc2 The influencer, boxer and \uc2 YouTube\uc2  personality \u8211\'20\'13 who has tens of millions of followers \u8211\'20\'13 recently spoke out about how his \u8220\'20\'1Cmind went to some dark places\u8221\'20\'1D when he found out his wife was pregnant with a girl. \u8220\'20\'1CI don\u8217\'20\'19t want to come across like a woke asshole, but like, dude, women have it hard,\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.the-independent.com/life-style/logan-paul-american-wife-pregnancy-woke-women-b2741313.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Paul said on his reality show}}}\uc2 . \u8220\'20\'1CWomen have it fucking hard. And I empathize with them.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Jill Sobule dies in a house fire aged 66\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/music/2025/may/02/jill-sobule-death-singer-dies-aged-66"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 musician\u8217\'20\'19s 1995 single}}}\uc2  I Kissed a Girl is considered the first openly LGBTQ+-themed song to crack the Billboard top 20 singles chart.\par \par \uc2 Breast cancer is becoming less deadly for younger women in the US\par \par \uc2 From 2010 to 2020, the number of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.reuters.com/business/healthcare-pharmaceuticals/health-rounds-breast-cancer-is-becoming-less-deadly-younger-women-us-study-finds-2025-05-02/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 breast cancer deaths}}}\uc2  among women ages 20-49 dropped significantly, researchers have reported.Breast cancer mortality fell across racial and ethnic groups, but in both 2010 and 2020, non-Hispanic Black women had the highest rate.\par \par \uc2 Why are more than 90% of pilots still men?\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CDespite more than a decade of initiatives designed to increase the number of women flying planes, just 6.5% of pilots working for UK companies are women,\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/lifeandstyle/2025/may/01/oh-youre-a-woman-why-are-more-than-90-of-pilots-still-men-and-can-anything-narrow-the-gender-gap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Amelia Gentleman reports}}}\uc2 . \u8220\'20\'1CThere is something stubbornly retro about gender roles in this industry. Female doctors began to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/society/2025/mar/06/female-doctors-outnumber-male-peers-in-uk-for-first-time"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 outnumber their male peers}}}\uc2  in the UK for the first time this year, but preconceptions about what an airline pilot should look and sound like have not shifted.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Texas senate approves legislation to clarify exceptions to extreme \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban\par \par \uc2 The new legislation, Senate Bill 31, aims to prevent maternal deaths under the state\u8217\'20\'19s strict \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban \u8211\'20\'13 and serves as an acknowledgment that women were being denied lifesaving care because of confusion about the limits of the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban. While it\u8217\'20\'19s a step forward, don\u8217\'20\'19t get too excited. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.propublica.org/article/texas-senate-abortion-ban-legislation-medical-exceptions"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ProPublica notes}}}\uc2 : \u8220\'20\'1CThe bill stops short of removing what doctors say are the ban\u8217\'20\'19s biggest impediments to care, including its major criminal penalties, and doesn\u8217\'20\'19t expand \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  access to cases of fetal anomalies, rape or incest.\u8221\'20\'1D The Texas senate has also just passed perhaps the broadest crackdown on {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.texastribune.org/2025/04/29/texas-senate-abortion-pill-bill/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22 -inducing drugs in the country}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Judge in Finland dismisses charges against three men accused of raping a 17-year-old girl outside a hospital\par \par \uc2 The girl was taken to Malmi hospital by an ambulance due to her severe intoxication, the Finnish newspaper {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.hs.fi/helsinki/art-2000011193871.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Helsingin Sanomat}}}\uc2  reports. Three men, two of whom were in their 30s, then took the 17-year-old out of the hospital and had violent intercourse with her, which they filmed. The Helsinki district court has held that the girl \u8211\'20\'13 who, again, had been brought to hospital because of intoxication, consented to all this and dismissed the charges against the men.\par \par \uc2 Cory Booker can speak nonstop for 25 hours, but has no comment about genocide\par \par \uc2 The New Jersey senator was heaped with praise by liberals for speaking for 25 hours on the Senate floor last month. \u8220\'20\'1CThis is not right or left. It is right or wrong. This is not a partisan moment. It is a moral moment,\u8221\'20\'1D Booker said during his speech. \u8220\'20\'1CWhere do you stand?\u8221\'20\'1D Stirring words, indeed. But Booker was awfully quiet this week after Shabtai, the Yale-based society he co-founded, invited {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/commentisfree/2025/apr/25/itamar-ben-gvir-yale-shabtai-israel"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the Israeli extremist Itamar Ben-Gvir}}}\uc2  \u8211\'20\'13 a man convicted of terrorism \u8211\'20\'13 to give a speech. Booker also took a smiling {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/mehdirhasan/status/1868278360796991741"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 photo in his office with Yoav Gallant}}}\uc2 , wanted by the international criminal court for war crimes, in his office last year. Booker is absolutely right that this is not a partisan moment, it is a moral moment. You are either for {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.amnesty.org/en/latest/news/2024/12/amnesty-international-concludes-israel-is-committing-genocide-against-palestinians-in-gaza/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 genocide}}}\uc2 , or you are against it. You are either for starving children and murdering {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.aljazeera.com/features/2025/4/7/targeted-killed-burned-alive-journalists-in-gaza-attacked-by-israel"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 journalists}}}\uc2 , or you are against it. Booker has made very clear where he stands. If Booker is the \u8220\'20\'1Cresistance\u8221\'20\'1D, we are all in trouble.\par \par \uc2 The week in pawtriarchy\par \par \uc2 The world\u8217\'20\'19s smallest dog (Pearl, chihuahua, 3.59 inches) and the world\u8217\'20\'19s tallest dog (Reggie, Great Dane, 3ft 3in) recently {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.instagram.com/p/DJDnlXlsUAS/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 got together}}}\uc2  for a playdate, and it was as {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.usatoday.com/story/news/nation/2025/05/01/worlds-tallest-smallest-dogs-guinness-records/83386913007/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 cute as it sounds}}}\uc2 . Despite the fact that most chihuahuas seem to have a mildly psychotic side (source: me, a chihuahua owner), Pearl was very chill around Reggie. I guess oppawsites attract.\par \par \uc2 \u8226\'20\'22 In the US, you can call or text the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://988lifeline.org/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 National Suicide Prevention Lifeline}}}\uc2  at 988, chat on {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://988lifeline.org/chat/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 988lifeline.org}}}\uc2 , or {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.crisistextline.org/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 text HOME}}}\uc2  to 741741 to connect with a crisis counselor. In the UK and Ireland, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.samaritans.org/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Samaritans}}}\uc2  can be contacted on freephone 116 123, or email {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "mailto:jo@samaritans.org"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 jo@samaritans.org}}}\uc2  or {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "mailto:jo@samaritans.ie"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 jo@samaritans.ie}}}\uc2 . In Australia, the crisis support service {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.lifeline.org.au/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Lifeline}}}\uc2  is 13 11 14. Other international helplines can be found at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.befrienders.org/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 befrienders.org}}}\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Arwa Mahdawi is a Guardian columnist\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020250503el53001p6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
