\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 New York adds protections for doctors who send  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  pills out of state\b0\par\par\uc2 Carter Sherman \par \uc2 430 \uc2 words\par \uc2 4 February 2025\par 20:33 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2025.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Democratic governor \uc2 Kathy Hochul\uc2  signs law permitting doctors to leave names off prescriptions for \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pills\par \par \uc2 New York state moved to increase protections for \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  providers who mail pills out of state, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/jan/31/new-york-louisiana-abortion-pill-charges"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 days after}}}\uc2  a Louisiana grand jury indicted a New York doctor for allegedly doing just that.\par \par \uc2 New York\u8217\'20\'19s Democratic governor, \uc2 Kathy Hochul\uc2 , on Monday signed into law a bill that permits doctors to request that their names be left off prescriptions for \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pills. Instead, they can use the names of their medical practices.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIn deeply conservative states, they\u8217\'20\'19ve weaponized the courts against providers, in state and out,\u8221\'20\'1D Hochul said in a press conference. She continued: \u8220\'20\'1COther states, they want to target, harass, scare, intimidate doctors and patients. That may be OK in a place like Louisiana, maybe Indiana. But those are not our values in the state of New York. No.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The new law arrives in the wake of intensified efforts to prosecute providers who use telemedicine to prescribe abortions to residents of states with \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  bans. These providers operate under the auspices of \u8220\'20\'1Cshield laws\u8221\'20\'1D, which have been enacted in a number of blue states since the \uc2 US supreme court\uc2  overturned Roe v Wade in 2022. They generally aim to protect \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  providers by refusing to comply with red-state requests to prosecute them.\par \par \uc2 Shield laws have proven vital to maintaining \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  access in the US post-Roe. Between April and June of last year, providers offered nearly 10,000 abortions each month through shield laws, according to data from #WeCount, a research project by the Society of Family Planning.\par \par \uc2 However, shield laws have gone largely untried in courts \u8211\'20\'13 and red states are now aiming to put them to the test. Late last year, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/dec/13/texas-abortion-pills-lawsuit-ken-paxton"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Texas attorney general, Ken Paxton, sued}}}\uc2  Dr Margaret Carpenter, a New York-based provider, who allegedly prescribed \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pills to a 20-year-old Texan. Carpenter is also the subject of last week\u8217\'20\'19s indictment by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/jan/31/new-york-louisiana-abortion-pill-charges"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 a Louisiana grand jury}}}\uc2 , which alleges she prescribed a pill in that state.\par \par \uc2 Louisiana law-enforcement officials also indicted the mother of a minor who was allegedly given the pill.\par \par \uc2 On Monday, Hochul vowed: \u8220\'20\'1CNever, under any circumstances, will I sign an extradition agreement that sends our doctor into harm\u8217\'20\'19s way, to be prosecuted as a criminal for simply following her oath.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Louisiana discovered Carpenter\u8217\'20\'19s name, Hochul said, because it was on the prescription bottle.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAfter today, that will no longer happen,\u8221\'20\'1D she said.\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020250204el24003bh\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
