\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 Judge allows lawsuit aiming to restrict  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  pills across US to proceed\b0\par\par\uc2 Carter Sherman \par \uc2 425 \uc2 words\par \uc2 17 January 2025\par 19:07 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2025.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Texas judge Matthew Kacsmaryk rules attorneys general of Idaho, Kansas and Missouri can continue mifepristone case\par \par \uc2 A lawsuit that aims to restrict nationwide access to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pills can proceed, a federal judge in Texas ruled on Thursday, months after the \uc2 US supreme court\uc2  rebuked an earlier version of the lawsuit {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/article/2024/jun/13/supreme-court-abortion-pill-mifepristone"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 over a legal technicality}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The US judge Matthew Kacsmaryk is allowing the attorneys general of Idaho, Kansas and Missouri to continue a case that takes aim at the \uc2 FDA\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s regulation of mifepristone, a drug typically used in medication abortions. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/joebiden"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Joe Biden}}}\uc2  \u8217\'20\'19s Department of Justice had asked for the case to be dismissed, arguing that the attorneys general had no real link to Kacsmaryk\u8217\'20\'19s court in the northern district of Texas.\par \par \uc2 Kacsmaryk, a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/donaldtrump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Donald Trump}}}\uc2  appointee, said in his ruling that it was too early in litigation to make that call.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CVenue remains disputed here,\u8221\'20\'1D he wrote, \u8220\'20\'1Cand should be properly dealt with at a phase where each party may fully argue the issue\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 The case could have sweeping implications for the availability of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  across the country, as medication abortions account for more than two-thirds of all US abortions.\par \par \uc2 The original version of the case, which was brought by a group of anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  activists, sought to roll back the \uc2 FDA\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s 2000 approval of mifepristone \u8211\'20\'13 a request Kacsmaryk granted but was later paused by an appeals court. In later litigation, the activists asked courts to reverse more recent \uc2 FDA\uc2  rule-making around mifepristone, such as a policy that permits providers to dispense the drug through telehealth.\par \par \uc2 Last year, the \uc2 US supreme court\uc2  ruled that the anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  activists behind the case lacked the necessary standing to sue. Although the activists dismissed their case, Idaho, Kansas and Missouri attorneys general filed a 199-page complaint arguing for their right to take up the case in the activists\u8217\'20\'19 stead.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThis outrageous case should have been put to bed,\u8221\'20\'1D Julia Kaye, a senior staff attorney with the \uc2 ACLU\uc2  Reproductive Freedom Project, said in a statement. \u8220\'20\'1CInstead, the same Texas judge who already tried to take mifepristone off the market nationwide has left the door open for extremist politicians to continue attacking medication \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  in his courtroom.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 It is not yet clear whether Trump\u8217\'20\'19s Department of Justice will continue to defend the \uc2 FDA\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s current regulation of mifepristone. Project 2025, the famous conservative playbook, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/aug/05/project-2025-abortion"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 urged the FDA}}}\uc2  to roll back its approval of mifepristone on its own.\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020250117el1h0025t\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
