\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 Out-of-state residents made up vast majority of Kansas abortions in 2023\b0\par\par\uc2 Carter Sherman \par \uc2 588 \uc2 words\par \uc2 9 January 2025\par 15:37 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2025.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Rise in abortions and patients from states such as Texas show how access has shifted since Roe\u8217\'20\'19s overturning\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/kansas"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Kansas}}}\uc2  providers performed a historic number of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/abortion"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 abortions}}}\uc2  in 2023 \u8211\'20\'13 and most of them were performed on out-of-state residents \u8211\'20\'13 in a sign of just how much the 2022 overturning of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/roe-v-wade"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Roe v Wade}}}\uc2  has rewritten the map of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  access and led women to flee their home states for the procedure.\par \par \uc2 More than 19,000 abortions took place in Kansas in 2023, a 58% increase from 2022, according to a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.kdhe.ks.gov/DocumentCenter/View/43918/-2023-Annual-Summary-Full-Report-PDF?bidId="}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 recent report}}}\uc2  from the Kansas department of health and environment. Of those, roughly 4,300 abortions were performed on Kansas residents, while about 15,000 were done on out-of-state residents.\par \par \uc2 Most of those out-of-state residents were from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.lonestarlive.com/news/2025/01/texans-made-up-a-majority-of-kansas-abortion-patients-in-2023.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Texas}}}\uc2 , Oklahoma and Missouri \u8211\'20\'13 three states that neighbor Kansas and have banned virtually all abortions.\par \par \uc2 The increase in Kansas abortions mirrors the national upswing in the procedure. In 2023, the \uc2 Guttmacher Institute\uc2 , which tracks abortions and restrictions, recorded more than 1m US abortions. That\u8217\'20\'19s the highest number documented in a decade.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIt really speaks to a bifurcation of access,\u8221\'20\'1D \uc2 Isaac Maddow-Zimet\uc2 , a \uc2 Guttmacher Institute\uc2  data scientist, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/nov/27/post-roe-abortion-rate"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told the Guardian}}}\uc2  late last year.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1COn one hand, you have many states where \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  has gotten incredibly difficult to access \u8211\'20\'13 states with total bans, states with six-week bans. Access has gotten much more difficult for people living in those states. And then, on the other hand, you have states with more protective laws where a lot of the things that people have been doing to ameliorate the effects of bans have also increased access to residents of those states.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Kansas has long been a national flashpoint in the debate over US abortions. In 1991, thousands of anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  protesters swarmed the state\u8217\'20\'19s clinics, leading to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.washingtonpost.com/archive/politics/1991/08/26/lessons-of-a-summer-of-abortion-protests/8df22aad-ab32-4f4c-b777-f6b0baf83e4c/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 more than 2,600 arrests}}}\uc2 . In 2009, an anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  activist shot George Tiller, one of the nation\u8217\'20\'19s most famous \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  providers, to death in Tiller\u8217\'20\'19s Wichita, Kansas, church.\par \par \uc2 More recently, in 2022, Kansas became the first state in the nation to hold a post-Roe ballot measure on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights. The red state stunned the country by voting overwhelmingly in favor of preserving \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights. Several other states, including the Republican strongholds of Ohio and Montana, have since gone on to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/ng-interactive/2024/nov/05/abortion-ballot-results-tracker-ban-states"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pass pro-\b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  ballot measures}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 In 2024, however, Kansas\u8217\'20\'19s Republican-controlled state legislature overrode the Democratic governor Laura Kelly to pass a bill dramatically expanding the government\u8217\'20\'19s record-keeping of the abortions performed in Kansas.\par \par \uc2 Except in medical emergencies, \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  providers are now required to ask patients to name the most important factor in their decision to get an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  as well as questions about their marital status, education level, recent experience with domestic violence and whether they have received financial assistance in the last 30 days.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights supporters have long warned that such extensive record-keeping can stigmatize the procedure and potentially endanger the privacy of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  patients. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/project-2025"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Project 2025}}}\uc2 , a famous wishlist of conservative policy proposals, has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/article/2024/aug/05/project-2025-abortion"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 suggested increasing}}}\uc2  the CDC\u8217\'20\'19s national \u8220\'20\'1Csurveillance\u8221\'20\'1D of abortions.\par \par \uc2 The wishlist urges the CDC to cut funds from states that do not supply the agency with information about \u8220\'20\'1Cexactly how many abortions take place within its borders, at what gestational age of the child, for what reason, the mother\u8217\'20\'19s state of residence, and by what method\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020250109el190028o\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
